  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_01",
      "hash64": "49A59F62ABD9D78F",
      "text": "哎呀……？\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，好久不见～[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_02",
      "hash64": "49A5A062ABD9D942",
      "text": "和之前见到你的时候相比，\\n你对美的打磨更上一层楼了。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "5D4C74E974ED2E0A",
      "text": "谢谢",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "5D4C73E974ED2C57",
      "text": "莉普你也是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_03a",
      "hash64": "FE4BCEAA032E697C",
      "text": "呵呵！率直的孩子就是好，\\n你要永远保持这个优点哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_03b",
      "hash64": "FE4BD1AA032E6E95",
      "text": "这种奉承话从哪儿学来的？\\n你步入了……大人的阶段？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_04",
      "hash64": "49A59A62ABD9CF10",
      "text": "哦……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你是代替也慈来的？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_05",
      "hash64": "49A59B62ABD9D0C3",
      "text": "老实说，她让我有点不自在。\\n那艳丽的气场跟我又很像……[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_06",
      "hash64": "49A59C62ABD9D276",
      "text": "所以你替她来，\\n我反而觉得很好。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_07",
      "hash64": "49A59D62ABD9D429",
      "text": "如果对手是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你的话，\\n莉普我就能自在地拿出实力来了。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_08",
      "hash64": "49A5A662ABD9E374",
      "text": "那么，赶快和莉普我\\n一起追求究极的美吧？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_retry",
      "hash64": "29C355AC84C94806",
      "text": "你好，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。\\n要和莉普我一起追求究极的美吗？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_09",
      "hash64": "49A5A762ABD9E527",
      "text": "呵呵，那就这样。\\n我们去对战场吧。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_10",
      "hash64": "49A8A462ABDC15E5",
      "text": "莉普我很忙的，\\n要赶紧回来找我哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
